<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Activer GitHub Pages — Guide</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; background: #f0f4f0; color: #1a2e1a; }
    .wrap { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1.5rem; }

    h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; color: #1B6B2F; margin-bottom: .3rem; }
    .sub { color: #666; margin-bottom: 2rem; font-size: .95rem; }

    .step {
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      border-left: 5px solid #1B6B2F;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.06);
    }
    .step-head {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: .75rem;
      margin-bottom: .75rem;
    }
    .num {
      width: 32px; height: 32px;
      background: #1B6B2F;
      color: #fff;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-weight: 800; font-size: .9rem;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .step-head h2 { font-size: 1.05rem; color: #1B6B2F; }
    .step p { font-size: .92rem; line-height: 1.7; color: #444; }

    .mock {
      background: #f8f8f8;
      border: 1px solid #ddd;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
      margin-top: .85rem;
      font-family: monospace;
      font-size: .85rem;
    }
    .mock-nav {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #ddd;
      padding-bottom: .5rem;
      margin-bottom: .75rem;
      font-size: .82rem;
      color: #555;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .mock-nav .active {
      color: #1B6B2F;
      font-weight: 700;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #1B6B2F;
      padding-bottom: .4rem;
      margin-bottom: -0.6rem;
    }
    .mock-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: .5rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
      font-size: .85rem;
    }
    .mock-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .mock-label { font-weight: 600; color: #222; }
    .mock-val { color: #555; }
    .mock-badge {
      background: #E8F5E9;
      color: #1B6B2F;
      padding: .2rem .65rem;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: .78rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .mock-btn {
      background: #1B6B2F;
      color: #fff;
      border: none;
      padding: .4rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: .82rem;
      cursor: default;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .mock-select {
      border: 1px solid #ccc;
      border-radius: 5px;
      padding: .3rem .6rem;
      font-size: .82rem;
      background: #fff;
    }
    .mock-section { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .mock-section-title {
      font-size: .78rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      color: #888;
      margin-bottom: .5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .alert {
      background: #FFF8E1;
      border: 1px solid #FFD54F;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
      margin-top: .85rem;
      font-size: .88rem;
      color: #555;
    }
    .alert strong { color: #B8860B; }

    .success {
      background: #E8F5E9;
      border: 1px solid #A5D6A7;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
      margin-top: .85rem;
      font-size: .88rem;
      color: #2E7D32;
    }
    .url-box {
      background: #1B6B2F;
      color: #fff;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      letter-spacing: .5px;
    }
    .url-box span { opacity: .7; font-size: .85rem; display: block; margin-bottom: .3rem; }
    .url-box strong { font-size: 1.2rem; }
    .url-box a { color: #FFD54F; text-decoration: none; }

    .cmd {
      background: #1e1e1e;
      color: #A5D6A7;
      border-radius: 7px;
      padding: .85rem 1.1rem;
      font-family: monospace;
      font-size: .88rem;
      margin-top: .75rem;
      line-height: 1.9;
    }
    .cmd .c { color: rgba(255,255,255,.35); }
    .cmd .w { color: #fff; }

    .divider { border: none; border-top: 2px dashed #cde; margin: .5rem 0 1rem; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

  <h1>🌾 Activer GitHub Pages pour TONTINE+</h1>
  <p class="sub">Objectif : <strong>doundou969.github.io/agri-tontine-diourbel</strong> — 3 étapes, ~3 minutes</p>

  <!-- ÉTAPE 0 : s'assurer que le code est pushé -->
  <div class="step">
    <div class="step-head"><div class="num">0</div><h2>Vérifier que le code est bien sur GitHub</h2></div>
    <p>Ouvrez un terminal dans le dossier du projet et exécutez :</p>
    <div class="cmd">
      <div class="c"># S'assurer que docs/index.html est committé et pushé</div>
      <div class="w">git add docs/ .github/workflows/pages.yml</div>
      <div class="w">git commit -m "feat: GitHub Pages + landing TONTINE+"</div>
      <div class="w">git push origin main</div>
    </div>
    <div class="alert">
      <strong>⚠️ Important :</strong> Le dossier <code>docs/</code> doit contenir <code>index.html</code> et être présent sur la branche <code>main</code> avant d'activer Pages.
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ÉTAPE 1 : Aller dans Settings -->
  <div class="step">
    <div class="step-head"><div class="num">1</div><h2>Ouvrir les Settings du repo</h2></div>
    <p>Sur <strong>github.com/doundou969/agri-tontine-diourbel</strong>, cliquer sur l'onglet <strong>Settings</strong> (tout à droite de la barre de navigation).</p>
    <div class="mock">
      <div class="mock-nav">
        <span>Code</span>
        <span>Issues</span>
        <span>Pull requests</span>
        <span>Actions</span>
        <span>Projects</span>
        <span class="active">⚙ Settings</span>
      </div>
      <div style="font-size:.82rem;color:#888;padding:.5rem 0;">
        → Vous êtes maintenant dans Settings
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ÉTAPE 2 : Pages dans le menu gauche -->
  <div class="step">
    <div class="step-head"><div class="num">2</div><h2>Cliquer sur "Pages" dans le menu gauche</h2></div>
    <p>Dans la colonne gauche de Settings, descendre jusqu'à la section <strong>Code and automation</strong> puis cliquer sur <strong>Pages</strong>.</p>
    <div class="mock">
      <div style="display:flex;gap:1.5rem;">
        <div style="min-width:160px;border-right:1px solid #eee;padding-right:1rem;font-size:.82rem;">
          <div style="color:#888;font-size:.75rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:.5rem;">Code and automation</div>
          <div style="padding:.35rem .5rem;border-radius:5px;color:#555;">Branches</div>
          <div style="padding:.35rem .5rem;border-radius:5px;color:#555;">Tags</div>
          <div style="padding:.35rem .5rem;border-radius:5px;color:#555;">Rules</div>
          <div style="padding:.35rem .5rem;border-radius:5px;background:#E8F5E9;color:#1B6B2F;font-weight:700;">📄 Pages ←</div>
          <div style="padding:.35rem .5rem;border-radius:5px;color:#555;">Actions</div>
        </div>
        <div style="font-size:.82rem;color:#888;padding-top:1rem;">
          Cliquer sur <strong style="color:#1B6B2F;">Pages</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ÉTAPE 3 : Configurer Source = GitHub Actions -->
  <div class="step">
    <div class="step-head"><div class="num">3</div><h2>Configurer la source : GitHub Actions</h2></div>
    <p>Dans la page Pages, sous <strong>Build and deployment</strong>, changer la <strong>Source</strong> de <em>Deploy from a branch</em> à <strong>GitHub Actions</strong>.</p>
    <div class="mock">
      <div class="mock-section">
        <div class="mock-section-title">Build and deployment</div>
        <div class="mock-row">
          <span class="mock-label">Source</span>
          <select class="mock-select">
            <option selected>GitHub Actions ✅</option>
            <option>Deploy from a branch</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="font-size:.82rem;color:#888;background:#f0f8f0;padding:.6rem .75rem;border-radius:6px;margin-top:.5rem;">
        ℹ️ Une fois sélectionné, GitHub détecte automatiquement votre fichier <code>.github/workflows/pages.yml</code>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="alert">
      <strong>⚠️ Alternative si "GitHub Actions" n'apparaît pas :</strong><br>
      Choisir <em>Deploy from a branch</em> → Branch: <strong>main</strong> → Folder: <strong>/docs</strong> → cliquer <strong>Save</strong>.
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ÉTAPE 4 : Attendre le déploiement -->
  <div class="step">
    <div class="step-head"><div class="num">4</div><h2>Attendre le déploiement (~2 minutes)</h2></div>
    <p>Aller dans l'onglet <strong>Actions</strong> du repo pour voir le workflow "Deploy GitHub Pages" tourner.</p>
    <div class="mock">
      <div class="mock-nav">
        <span>Code</span>
        <span class="active">⚡ Actions</span>
        <span>Settings</span>
      </div>
      <div class="mock-row">
        <span>🟡 Deploy GitHub Pages</span>
        <span class="mock-val" style="font-size:.8rem;">En cours...</span>
      </div>
      <div class="mock-row" style="margin-top:.3rem;">
        <span>✅ Deploy GitHub Pages</span>
        <span class="mock-badge">Succès</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="success">
      ✅ Quand le workflow passe au vert → votre site est en ligne !
    </div>
  </div>

  <hr class="divider"/>

  <!-- URL FINALE -->
  <div class="url-box">
    <span>Votre site sera accessible à :</span>
    <strong><a href="https://doundou969.github.io/agri-tontine-diourbel" target="_blank">
      doundou969.github.io/agri-tontine-diourbel
    </a></strong>
  </div>

  <!-- SI ÇA NE MARCHE PAS -->
  <div class="step" style="margin-top:1.5rem;border-left-color:#C8871A;">
    <div class="step-head"><div class="num" style="background:#C8871A;">?</div><h2>Si le 404 persiste après activation</h2></div>
    <p>Vérifier ces 3 points dans l'ordre :</p>
    <div class="cmd">
      <div class="c"># 1. Vérifier que docs/index.html est bien dans main</div>
      <div class="w">git ls-files docs/</div>
      <div style="height:.5rem;"></div>
      <div class="c"># 2. Forcer un nouveau déploiement</div>
      <div class="w">git commit --allow-empty -m "chore: trigger Pages deploy"</div>
      <div class="w">git push origin main</div>
      <div style="height:.5rem;"></div>
      <div class="c"># 3. Vérifier l'URL exacte (sensible à la casse)</div>
      <div class="w">https://doundou969.github.io/agri-tontine-diourbel</div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
